eration of office buildings and coworking spaces in India. The company offers office spaces, including private and managed offices; coworking spaces; and value-added services such as fit-out customization, events and hospitality, F&B services, technology services, overages, shoots and studios, parking, and solutions for global capability centers. It also provides advertising services through digital signage, ads in community newsletters, tabletops and standees, in-app and email notifications, and brand promotional spaces. In addition, the company operates Rivet, a design and build workspace company that provides existing site analysis and technical due diligence, spatial and space type planning, design concepts, electro-mechanical design, building management system integration and IoT design, arts and graphics, wayfinding and signage, project management, testing and commissioning, and documentation and handover of fit-out services. Further, it offers digital products comprising WeWork All Access, a monthly coworking membership that gives individuals and teams access to WeWork centers; Virtual Office, which provides members with a registered address for company incorporation, GST, and statutory filings; WeWork On-Demand, a flexible pay-per-use access to WeWork; and WeWork Workplace, a SaaS platform for workspace management. The company serves Fortune 500 companies, large enterprises, global capability centers, mid-sized businesses, startups, and independent professionals. WeWork India Management Limited was incorporated in 2016 and is based in Bengaluru, India.","employees":999,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":null,"asOf":1795452787},"analyst":{"key":"strong_buy","mean":1,"n":9,"tMean":886.1111,"tHigh":995,"tLow":791,"tMed":856,"currency":"INR","asOf":1795452787,"trend":{"strongBuy":0,"buy":9,"hold":0,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}},"cap":"Micro","caFix":null,"fetched":1795452787,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\